I tried removing the boxy frames. That helped, but I still wanted to loosen it up.

Cartridge covers gave me something to work with: big type, a few strong colours and room for things to overlap. Having worked in newspaper graphics and print production, I also liked thinking of the homepage as a cover with the writing behind it.

